# Initial objections

1. A checksum alone cannot prove review quality.
2. A fixture must not be confused with a formal release.
3. A self-reviewer must not certify Gate 2.
4. A reviewer may quote `REV-YYYY-NNN`, `PASS / PARTIAL / FAIL`, or `replace-with-example` while explaining a rejected mutation.

